{
  "name": "Mano Ya - Mantenimiento diario",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "30 3 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Disparador diario",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -360,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Se ejecuta todos los dias a las 03:30 (hora del servidor de n8n). Si tu n8n esta en UTC, ajusta la expresion cron."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/rpc/run_maintenance",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "{{SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer {{SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Ejecutar run_maintenance",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -100,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continue",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "notes": "Llama a la RPC public.run_maintenance() por el endpoint REST de Supabase. Necesita la service role key (clave secreta) porque la funcion ignora RLS. Sustituye {{SUPABASE_URL}} y {{SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY}} por los valores reales."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const entrada = $input.first().json;\nconst ok = entrada.error === undefined && entrada.code === undefined;\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      ok,\n      fecha: new Date().toISOString(),\n      detalle: ok\n        ? 'Mantenimiento ejecutado correctamente.'\n        : 'Error al ejecutar el mantenimiento: ' + JSON.stringify(entrada),\n    },\n  },\n];"
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Resumir ejecucion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        160,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Deja un resumen legible de la ejecucion. Puedes conectar aqui un nodo de Slack o de correo si quieres recibir un aviso cuando falle."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Disparador diario": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Ejecutar run_maintenance",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Ejecutar run_maintenance": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Resumir ejecucion",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveManualExecutions": true
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "mano-ya"
    }
  ]
}
